# Credential files: match the shape, not a name someone happened to think of. A backup like
# accounts.json.bak, an override like accounts.local.json, or a file named my-accounts.json must be
# ignored too, or a public repo leaks a key.
*account*.json*
!accounts.example.json
.env*
*.bak
*.save
data/
__pycache__/
.ruff_cache/
docs/plans/
docs/superpowers/
.cortexkit/
.superpowers/
*.db-*
